WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.700
What Parliament Has Documented.

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:11.975
The Standing Committee on National Defence heard clear evidence: the CFNIS investigates matters involving the same chain of command it reports to.

00:00:11.975 --> 00:00:14.425
That is not independence.

00:00:14.425 --> 00:00:20.987
That is a structural conflict of interest that remains unaddressed despite repeated parliamentary warnings.
